flowchart TD
    A[Admin opens PENDING_APPROVAL] --> B{Expired?}
    B -- Yes --> E[Set EXPIRED]
    B -- No --> C{Decision}
    C -- Reject --> R[Set REJECTED]
    C -- Approve --> D{Agent active and no overlap?}
    D -- No --> X[Approval fails; remain PENDING_APPROVAL]
    D -- Yes --> F[Set CONFIRMED]
